# Timeline

This document records the major public milestones in the development of Spiral Civilization.

It is not a complete history of every idea.

It is a chronological record of significant public events, publications and releases that document the evolution of the project.

---

## Before 2026

Development of the project's core ideas through personal research, handwritten notebooks, recorded reflections and conversations.

---

## 11 January 2026

First public release of the Spiral Civilization Manifesto.

---

## 21 July 2026

Registration of the domain:

https://spiralcivilization.org

Beginning of the website development.

---

## 3 August 2026

First complete public version of the Home section.

Publication of Expedition Zero.

Publication of Letter 01.

---

## 5 August 2026

Creation of the public GitHub repository.

Beginning of the historical archive of Spiral Civilization.
